Convenient Name Tags for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.4.1)

A port of Convenient Name Tags 1.1.0 by Mim1q.
Original source: https://www.curseforge.com/projects/662763
Original licence: Apache-2.0

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust as a Horizon native mod (the mod API plus
the [[native.mixin]] patches and game modules listed in horizon-mod.toml; no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (Apache-2.0); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

LICENSE is the Apache-2.0 text (the jar names Apache-2.0 and has no licence file).
